The rewrite is at `agent-work/rewrite/2.4.md`. It starts with `## 2.4 · CRLB` and is only that file.

It runs longer than the ~2347-character target, because I kept every "why", named symbol and arithmetic step as the rules require. The Q1 2023 "exactly one FALSE" question is the one place where the answer key and the facts disagree. The key marks (b), but "strictly positive" in (c) is also doubtful, since $\mathcal I=0$ when $p$ does not depend on $\theta$. I flagged this in the sheet rather than resolving it. The Jan 2022 "decreases linearly" option is marked TRUE in the key, though the bound is really $\propto 1/N$; that is also noted.
